FFmpeg in TextMouth

This software uses libraries from the FFmpeg project under the LGPLv2.1.

TextMouth converts the audio of the formats macOS and iOS cannot read (Windows Media,
Matroska and WebM, AVI, Flash video, RealMedia, Musepack, and Speex) with FFmpeg's
libavformat, libavcodec, libswresample, and libavutil, linked statically, under the GNU
Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later (COPYING.LGPLv2.1 and LICENSE.md, beside
this file). No part of FFmpeg under the GPL is built: configure was not given --enable-gpl,
--enable-nonfree, or --enable-version3, and its summary says "License: LGPL version 2.1 or
later".

The release: FFmpeg 9.0.2, unmodified, from https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-9.0.2.tar.xz
Its SHA-256: 8c3850283eb25fa026482078a04051e0be17347b09ef81a0849bec15a96e002e
It is signed by FFmpeg's release key, fingerprint FCF986EA15E6E293A5644F10B4322F04D67658D8.
When ffmpeg.org cannot be reached, the build takes FFmpeg's own mirror's archive of the tag n9.0.2
instead, from https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/archive/refs/tags/n9.0.2.tar.gz
Its SHA-256: 6e374ed621e48faa40639307dff48ba6fe574a509977956d2cce9669b7cc27e9
The two hold the same files, but for the release's VERSION file, which the tag's archive lacks, and
git's own files (.gitattributes and .gitignore files), which the tarball lacks.

TextMouth's own source, which is public under the MIT License, holds the script that
downloads, checks, and builds this release (Scripts/vendor/ffmpeg/build.py), so anyone can
build the app with a changed FFmpeg. The configure line of each platform, run by that
script, where tmff-cc is Xcode's clang given the platform's SDK:

The Mac (macOS 14.0, arm64):

configure --disable-everything --disable-autodetect --disable-network --disable-programs --disable-doc --disable-avdevice --disable-swscale --disable-avfilter --enable-static --disable-shared --disable-debug --enable-zlib '--cc=tmff-cc --target=arm64-apple-macos14.0' '--as=tmff-cc --target=arm64-apple-macos14.0' --enable-demuxer=asf --enable-demuxer=matroska --enable-demuxer=flv --enable-demuxer=avi --enable-demuxer=rm --enable-demuxer=mpc --enable-demuxer=mpc8 --enable-demuxer=ogg --enable-decoder=wmav1 --enable-decoder=wmav2 --enable-decoder=wmapro --enable-decoder=wmalossless --enable-decoder=wmavoice --enable-decoder=speex --enable-decoder=mpc7 --enable-decoder=mpc8 --enable-decoder=cook --enable-decoder=sipr --enable-decoder=atrac3 --enable-decoder=ralf --enable-decoder=ra_144 --enable-decoder=ra_288 --enable-decoder=aac --enable-decoder=mp3float --enable-decoder=mp2float --enable-decoder=ac3 --enable-decoder=eac3 --enable-decoder=opus --enable-decoder=vorbis --enable-decoder=dca --enable-decoder=flac --enable-decoder=alac --enable-decoder=truehd --enable-decoder=mlp --enable-decoder=tta --enable-decoder=wavpack --enable-decoder=ape --enable-decoder=pcm_s16le --enable-decoder=pcm_s16be --enable-decoder=pcm_s24le --enable-decoder=pcm_s24be --enable-decoder=pcm_s32le --enable-decoder=pcm_s32be --enable-decoder=pcm_f32le --enable-decoder=pcm_f32be --enable-decoder=pcm_f64le --enable-decoder=pcm_f64be --enable-decoder=pcm_u8 --enable-decoder=pcm_s8 --enable-decoder=pcm_alaw --enable-decoder=pcm_mulaw --enable-decoder=adpcm_ms --enable-decoder=adpcm_ima_wav --enable-decoder=adpcm_swf --enable-decoder=nellymoser --enable-decoder=gsm_ms --enable-parser=aac --enable-parser=ac3 --enable-parser=cook --enable-parser=dca --enable-parser=flac --enable-parser=gsm --enable-parser=mlp --enable-parser=mpegaudio --enable-parser=opus --enable-parser=sipr --enable-parser=vorbis

The iPhone (iOS 26.0, arm64):

configure --disable-everything --disable-autodetect --disable-network --disable-programs --disable-doc --disable-avdevice --disable-swscale --disable-avfilter --enable-static --disable-shared --disable-debug --enable-zlib '--cc=tmff-cc --target=arm64-apple-ios26.0' '--as=tmff-cc --target=arm64-apple-ios26.0' --enable-cross-compile --target-os=darwin --arch=aarch64 --enable-demuxer=asf --enable-demuxer=matroska --enable-demuxer=flv --enable-demuxer=avi --enable-demuxer=rm --enable-demuxer=mpc --enable-demuxer=mpc8 --enable-demuxer=ogg --enable-decoder=wmav1 --enable-decoder=wmav2 --enable-decoder=wmapro --enable-decoder=wmalossless --enable-decoder=wmavoice --enable-decoder=speex --enable-decoder=mpc7 --enable-decoder=mpc8 --enable-decoder=cook --enable-decoder=sipr --enable-decoder=atrac3 --enable-decoder=ralf --enable-decoder=ra_144 --enable-decoder=ra_288 --enable-decoder=aac --enable-decoder=mp3float --enable-decoder=mp2float --enable-decoder=ac3 --enable-decoder=eac3 --enable-decoder=opus --enable-decoder=vorbis --enable-decoder=dca --enable-decoder=flac --enable-decoder=alac --enable-decoder=truehd --enable-decoder=mlp --enable-decoder=tta --enable-decoder=wavpack --enable-decoder=ape --enable-decoder=pcm_s16le --enable-decoder=pcm_s16be --enable-decoder=pcm_s24le --enable-decoder=pcm_s24be --enable-decoder=pcm_s32le --enable-decoder=pcm_s32be --enable-decoder=pcm_f32le --enable-decoder=pcm_f32be --enable-decoder=pcm_f64le --enable-decoder=pcm_f64be --enable-decoder=pcm_u8 --enable-decoder=pcm_s8 --enable-decoder=pcm_alaw --enable-decoder=pcm_mulaw --enable-decoder=adpcm_ms --enable-decoder=adpcm_ima_wav --enable-decoder=adpcm_swf --enable-decoder=nellymoser --enable-decoder=gsm_ms --enable-parser=aac --enable-parser=ac3 --enable-parser=cook --enable-parser=dca --enable-parser=flac --enable-parser=gsm --enable-parser=mlp --enable-parser=mpegaudio --enable-parser=opus --enable-parser=sipr --enable-parser=vorbis

The iPhone simulator (iOS 26.0, arm64):

configure --disable-everything --disable-autodetect --disable-network --disable-programs --disable-doc --disable-avdevice --disable-swscale --disable-avfilter --enable-static --disable-shared --disable-debug --enable-zlib '--cc=tmff-cc --target=arm64-apple-ios26.0-simulator' '--as=tmff-cc --target=arm64-apple-ios26.0-simulator' --enable-cross-compile --target-os=darwin --arch=aarch64 --enable-demuxer=asf --enable-demuxer=matroska --enable-demuxer=flv --enable-demuxer=avi --enable-demuxer=rm --enable-demuxer=mpc --enable-demuxer=mpc8 --enable-demuxer=ogg --enable-decoder=wmav1 --enable-decoder=wmav2 --enable-decoder=wmapro --enable-decoder=wmalossless --enable-decoder=wmavoice --enable-decoder=speex --enable-decoder=mpc7 --enable-decoder=mpc8 --enable-decoder=cook --enable-decoder=sipr --enable-decoder=atrac3 --enable-decoder=ralf --enable-decoder=ra_144 --enable-decoder=ra_288 --enable-decoder=aac --enable-decoder=mp3float --enable-decoder=mp2float --enable-decoder=ac3 --enable-decoder=eac3 --enable-decoder=opus --enable-decoder=vorbis --enable-decoder=dca --enable-decoder=flac --enable-decoder=alac --enable-decoder=truehd --enable-decoder=mlp --enable-decoder=tta --enable-decoder=wavpack --enable-decoder=ape --enable-decoder=pcm_s16le --enable-decoder=pcm_s16be --enable-decoder=pcm_s24le --enable-decoder=pcm_s24be --enable-decoder=pcm_s32le --enable-decoder=pcm_s32be --enable-decoder=pcm_f32le --enable-decoder=pcm_f32be --enable-decoder=pcm_f64le --enable-decoder=pcm_f64be --enable-decoder=pcm_u8 --enable-decoder=pcm_s8 --enable-decoder=pcm_alaw --enable-decoder=pcm_mulaw --enable-decoder=adpcm_ms --enable-decoder=adpcm_ima_wav --enable-decoder=adpcm_swf --enable-decoder=nellymoser --enable-decoder=gsm_ms --enable-parser=aac --enable-parser=ac3 --enable-parser=cook --enable-parser=dca --enable-parser=flac --enable-parser=gsm --enable-parser=mlp --enable-parser=mpegaudio --enable-parser=opus --enable-parser=sipr --enable-parser=vorbis
